-- coa29-tests-sch8.l4: tests for coa29-sch8.l4 (Schedule 8: the Act's index of defined expressions).
-- Generated by work/gen_tests_sch8.py from a second reading of the text. One assertion per live row for the expression as the index prints it,
-- one more for the expression without its trailing scope where the row has one, and hand-written cases for expressions with several rows.

GIVEN expression IS A STRING
      wanted IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`sch 8 test the lookup lists` MEANS
    CONSIDER `sch 8 the provisions that define or explain the expression` expression
    WHEN JUST lines THEN elem wanted lines
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `One assertion per row`

